<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-CP Ventures advises wait on offer.</title>
<headline>RTRS-CP Ventures advises wait on offer.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>CP Ventures Ltd said on Wednesday it had not yet considered a buy-out offer from fellow investment group Innerhadden Ltd.</p>
<p>Directors recommended that sharehoholders wait for formal advice in its Part B response statement, which would be accompanied by an independent expert's report.</p>
<p>Innerhadden, which holds 86 percent of CP Ventures, said on Monday it planned to offer 78 a share for shares it did not own.</p>
<p>It would also offer 3.895 cents cash for each CP Ventures managers share.</p>
<p>CP Ventures last traded at 69 cents on October 30.  </p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
